# Byte-level tests read assets/i18n/*.json off the working tree and assert LF
# newlines plus a byte-exact re-encode (test/presentation/i18n/locale_parity_test.dart,
# "en_GB.json is well formed"). Windows checkouts default to core.autocrlf=true and
# rewrite the JSON to CRLF, failing those assertions on the working tree while the
# repo bytes stay fine (CI run 41730397754, windows-latest only). Force LF so the
# working tree matches the repo bytes on every OS.
assets/i18n/*.json text eol=lf
